==================================================
USE ONE PURE MIGRATION HELPER
==================================================

Extract a helper with NO React state writes:

    function pickupGridFromLegacyRows(rows, baseGrid) {
        const out = Array.isArray(baseGrid)
            ? baseGrid.slice()
            : new Array(28*28).fill(0);

        (rows || []).forEach((row, r) => {
            String(row || '').split('').forEach((c, col) => {
                if (c !== '6' && c !== '7') return;

                const slot = (r * 2) * 28 + (col * 2);

                if (!out[slot])
                    out[slot] = c === '6' ? 1 : 2;
            });
        });

        return out;
    }

The exact helper name is unimportant.

The important properties are:

    PURE
    ADDITIVE
    NON-DESTRUCTIVE
    DETERMINISTIC

Do not modify rows inside it.

